===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not able to be [[control]]led, [[contain]]ed or [[govern]]ed.
#: ''She got the '''uncontrollable''' urge for some chocolate.''
#* {{RQ:Landon Ethel Churchill|page=273|volume=II|passage="Ethel!" exclaimed Norbourne, his strong and '''uncontrollable''' emotion betraying the power that her name still had over him: he tried to say something more, but the words died on his lips.}}

